I go out onto the street.
I walk to the U-Bahn.
The sky is heavy and dark grey.
A cold wind is blowing.
It is really cold today.
Suddenly it snows a little.
But then comes icy rain.
Now it is raining hard.
The rain is ice-cold.
I quickly open my umbrella.
I am freezing.
I pull my coat tighter.
I hurry.
There are the stairs to the station.
I go down quickly.
The platform is dry.
It is better down here.
I look at my mobile phone.
It will rain a lot more today.
